---
name: setext-headings-fixture
description: exercises setext heading round-tripping for adept_fmt tests.
---

# Top Setext

some text

## Sub Setext

more text

### Atx H3

done

## > quoted heading

Text whose leading word is block-marker-like must not be emitted in setext form: reparsed,
`> quoted heading` on its own line would read as a blockquote, not a heading.

## 1. numbered heading

Same hazard, ordered-list-marker shaped.

## - dashed heading

Same hazard, bullet-marker shaped.

## # hash heading

Same hazard, a bare `#` run.
